WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.967
Lab 2 uses a test
domain, never production,

2
00:00:02.967 --> 00:00:07.771
with Chapter 6's second lab already
done, a SailPoint sandbox scoped

3
00:00:07.771 --> 00:00:12.575
to the service account unit, and
Defender for Identity on the domain.

4
00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:14.137
The authors haven't run it.

5
00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:16.099
Write the test domain's settings.

6
00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:19.096
Then put the real exports
into the kit's formats,

7
00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:21.400
mapping each product column by hand.

8
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.044
Run with a live read of the domain; a
group managed account you made by hand in

9
00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:29.415
Chapter 6 with no request
shows up as finding eighteen,

10
00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:31.363
which is the drift rule working.

11
00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:36.600
Finally, confirm the manifest shows one
read of Active Directory, and nothing else.
